<title>USA: Helen of Troy Q3 Nov 30 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Helen of Troy Q3 Nov 30 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>EL PASO, Texas 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>HELEN OF TROY LTD</p>
<p>			    3 Mos ended	    9 Mos ended</p>
<p>			11/30/96    11/30/95  11/30/96     11/30/95</p>
<p> Net Sales   $74,477,000 $55,353,000 $168,804,000 $131,579,000</p>
<p> Net Earnings  7,805,000   5,974,000   14,302,000   11,013,000</p>
<p> EPS (see note)	.56	   .45	   1.04	    .82</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs 13,964,888 13,334,122   13,776,155   13,379,166</p>
<p>NOTE: EPS adjusted for a 2-for-1 stock split paid July 1, 1996, as a 100 percent stock dividend on the company's common stock.</p>
</text>
